talics.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f7b427fb2d880e16df4ed1025a43b47c/sheets-nonmodal-notes-text-italic%402x.png","line":19,"embedded":true},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets#Best-practices","line":23},{"title":"going full screen","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/going-full-screen","line":27},{"title":"Immersive experiences","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/immersive-experiences","line":27},{"title":"`UIModalPresentationStyle.fullScreen`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIModalPresentationStyle/fullScreen","line":27},{"title":"panel","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/panels","line":31},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets#iOS-iPadOS","line":31},{"title":"split view","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/split-views","line":31},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets#Platform-considerations","line":33},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets#iOS-iPadOS","line":37},{"title":"An illustration showing an iPhone screen in portrait orientation containing a solid rounded rectangle that occupies almost all of the screen, representing a full-screen sheet. A rounded close button appears in the upper-left corner of the sheet.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/c2a600adb5237892585d71d2ae61c9a6/sheets-large-detent%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration showing an iPhone screen in portrait orientation containing a solid rounded rectangle that occupies half of the screen, representing a half-screen sheet. A rounded close button appears in the upper-left corner o